WEBVTT

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:24.691
Let's go and don't cry, funny

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:27.627
Give me a dumbass dream, please

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:29.863
Don't touch me, baby

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:33.066
Freedom, baby

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:38.972
I'm elastic, I want to be chained

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:43.576
Can you feel it? The nonsensical afterimage

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:55.321
Even the moments of points and lines
disappear after failing to show

00:00:55.321 --> 00:01:01.061
The sad forefront, an empty sensation

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:06.733
Sweet remnants that tear at my heart

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:12.405
Scattering Polaroids, gathering paranoia

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:17.577
I want you to tell me whose turn is next

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:30.945
If you sleep close to this incomplete
form, you'll understand and see

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:35.829
Stop!

00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:38.164
We were told to examine that in detail!

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:40.100
I haven't taken all of him!

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:43.203
This is just one part of Gerd!
At least let him have a funeral!

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:46.439
I can't do that! That's a very precious sample!

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:50.170
Who're you calling
a sample?! Gerd was a person!

00:01:56.516 --> 00:01:57.951
S-Stop!

00:01:57.951 --> 00:02:01.955
It's not that much. Just get back to work.

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:04.389
Y-Yes, sir...

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:16.736
I will make him pay!

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:18.471
Hermann.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:23.033
How could you take Malek
somewhere so dangerous?

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:32.385
I'm sorry about Malek. I just thought...

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:36.156
But why didn't you take him back home?

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:40.360
Huh? But I did take him back to your place.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:47.664
Eh? Y-You did? He must've
gone somewhere then...

00:02:49.369 --> 00:02:52.736
Amanda, did something
happen between you two?

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:59.512
I've been away so much
ever since the racetrack incident

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:02.649
that I haven't had much time for Malek...

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:07.353
Nah, he's a guy. I'm sure it's nothing to him.

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:11.057
Remember when I told
you he was being bullied?

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:12.792
Yeah.

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:17.664
I thought the counseling
was finally starting to help

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:22.569
but I guess the bullying continued,
because he quit going to school.

00:03:22.569 --> 00:03:23.934
Oh...

00:03:25.438 --> 00:03:29.306
Wanting to make Malek happy...
I was so naïve back then.

00:03:31.211 --> 00:03:36.015
She's going to be your big sister
starting today. Say hello, Malek.

00:03:36.015 --> 00:03:41.321
U-Umm... I'm Malek Yildrim.

00:03:41.321 --> 00:03:43.423
It's nice to meet you.

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:47.427
I'm Amanda Werner. It's nice to meet you, too.

00:03:47.427 --> 00:03:51.164
Starting today, you're Malek Werner.

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:53.666
Thank you.

00:03:53.666 --> 00:03:57.103
I adopted him, but I've been terrible at this.

00:03:57.103 --> 00:04:00.573
I guess I never understood him,
not even a little bit...

00:04:00.573 --> 00:04:03.676
Amanda, don't blame yourself so much.

00:04:03.676 --> 00:04:07.714
Not just anyone can take in an orphan.

00:04:07.714 --> 00:04:11.684
I've always been impressed.

00:04:11.684 --> 00:04:13.019
Thanks.

00:04:13.019 --> 00:04:15.455
I'm going to look for Malek.

00:04:15.455 --> 00:04:19.653
Probably at a friend's house.
He'll be back soon!

00:04:25.131 --> 00:04:27.400
Hey, Hermann.

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.436
The captain wants to
have a nice chat with you.

00:04:30.436 --> 00:04:34.674
Keep acting all reckless and
you'll end up court-martialed eventually.

00:04:34.674 --> 00:04:36.976
Yeah, I know.

00:04:36.976 --> 00:04:42.778
Good to hear, but the captain
can't cover for you forever.

00:04:47.387 --> 00:04:50.083
I guess he's not coming back...

00:04:52.959 --> 00:04:56.029
Gerd lost on purpose...

00:04:56.029 --> 00:04:57.463
Why?!

00:04:57.463 --> 00:05:02.730
He could've just gone after
everyone who treated him like a monster!

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:07.740
That's where the real suffering begins.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:13.542
The pain of hurting others is
often worse than the pain of being hurt.

00:05:19.986 --> 00:05:22.250
That can't be true!

00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:36.436
Why?

00:05:36.436 --> 00:05:38.338
Why what?

00:05:38.338 --> 00:05:40.707
Why aren't you leaving town?

00:05:40.707 --> 00:05:44.905
Don't tell me you're concerned about that boy?

00:05:48.414 --> 00:05:54.250
Joseph, you've been so
unbeautiful lately, you know that?

00:05:57.090 --> 00:06:02.392
He should just beat up everyone who's bad!

00:06:06.699 --> 00:06:08.167
Hey, Johann!

00:06:08.167 --> 00:06:11.204
You went to Malek's yesterday, didn't you?!

00:06:11.204 --> 00:06:15.274
Just when we let you join us,
you wanna go and undo everything?!

00:06:15.274 --> 00:06:17.443
Umm...

00:06:17.443 --> 00:06:20.606
What do you boys want with Johann?

00:06:25.918 --> 00:06:29.956
Oh, is that one of them toys?!

00:06:29.956 --> 00:06:35.261
Just look at this crap she makes
and goes around trying to sell!

00:06:35.261 --> 00:06:36.963
Damn, that's so cheap!

00:06:36.963 --> 00:06:40.867
Like anyone would buy this junk!

00:06:40.867 --> 00:06:44.701
- See ya, Johann!
- Let's play again sometime!

00:06:47.006 --> 00:06:53.012
Don't cry, you two. I'll make another one.

00:06:53.012 --> 00:06:55.310
It'll be all right...

00:06:58.818 --> 00:07:01.521
I'm sorry, Katarzyna...

00:07:01.521 --> 00:07:05.158
I'm sorry, Tadeusz...

00:07:05.158 --> 00:07:07.927
I'm sorry, Mom...

00:07:07.927 --> 00:07:10.430
I'm sorry, Malek...

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:13.228
I'm sorry, God...

00:07:15.968 --> 00:07:18.271
You got one week.

00:07:18.271 --> 00:07:22.675
During that time, check the files
of everyone who was at the racetrack

00:07:22.675 --> 00:07:24.510
and come up with any suspects!

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:25.978
Are you serious?

00:07:25.978 --> 00:07:29.937
Special leave. Enough to
make even me jealous.

00:07:32.618 --> 00:07:34.887
By the way...

00:07:34.887 --> 00:07:39.859
You're not hiding anything dangerous like this

00:07:39.859 --> 00:07:43.129
to mess with the lock, are ya?

00:07:43.129 --> 00:07:47.366
No. I'll behave and do my work.

00:07:47.366 --> 00:07:49.357
It's best that you do.

00:08:02.148 --> 00:08:03.883
Boss? Are you feeling ill?

00:08:03.883 --> 00:08:07.353
Yeah... It's a cold, apparently...

00:08:07.353 --> 00:08:10.723
I got some pills from the medical center.

00:08:10.723 --> 00:08:13.817
It's like the devil getting sunstroke, I guess.

00:08:17.763 --> 00:08:20.099
Good news. Extra work.

00:08:20.099 --> 00:08:24.237
We're supposed to give this to
the captain. It has info about Blue.

00:08:24.237 --> 00:08:27.840
Yeesh. Is it a disk or something?

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:32.445
I bet there's just some
naked chicks on it or something.

00:08:32.445 --> 00:08:37.250
The lady who brought it
was super-hot herself, actually!

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:41.521
Joseph, you're taking too little action.

00:08:41.521 --> 00:08:45.514
We can't disappoint Xargin-sama, now can we?

00:08:52.398 --> 00:08:57.169
Malek, are you home?

00:08:57.169 --> 00:08:59.705
Malek?

00:08:59.705 --> 00:09:01.605
I'm coming in.

00:09:12.351 --> 00:09:17.390
Please give this to him!
Tell him I bought a new one!

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:20.188
I'm sorry I'm so gutless...

00:09:37.577 --> 00:09:40.112
H-He couldn't be...!

00:09:40.112 --> 00:09:43.516
Malek... I'm really sorry...

00:09:43.516 --> 00:09:50.156
I know you'll probably never
forgive me for it, but I beat you up.

00:09:50.156 --> 00:09:53.025
I knew I was horrible for doing it,

00:09:53.025 --> 00:09:58.130
but I thought it would be worth
it to have them stop beating me up.

00:09:58.130 --> 00:10:00.933
But I was wrong.

00:10:00.933 --> 00:10:05.338
The pain is still there, and
hurts much worse than being beaten.

00:10:05.338 --> 00:10:09.241
And I'm afraid to sleep, because
I have dreams about beating you up

00:10:09.241 --> 00:10:13.479
that are so painful that I can barely breathe.

00:10:13.479 --> 00:10:20.052
Even so, if they told me to,
I'd probably beat you up again...

00:10:20.052 --> 00:10:23.990
Again and again, even...

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:27.126
Johann!

00:10:27.126 --> 00:10:29.762
Where is Johann-kun?!

00:10:29.762 --> 00:10:32.832
In his room, I think...

00:10:32.832 --> 00:10:37.036
Johann! Are you in there?! Please! Open up!

00:10:37.036 --> 00:10:41.974
- And for that, I hate myself...
- Johann! Please! Open up!

00:10:41.974 --> 00:10:45.466
I absolutely hate myself...

00:10:46.345 --> 00:10:48.981
Which is why...

00:10:48.981 --> 00:10:50.816
Johann!

00:10:50.816 --> 00:10:54.582
...I've decided to run from it all.

00:10:58.424 --> 00:11:02.121
Ma'am! Call an ambulance! Hurry!

00:11:03.729 --> 00:11:06.289
What are you doing?! Hurry!

00:11:26.819 --> 00:11:30.156
They said he killed himself.

00:11:30.156 --> 00:11:31.891
He was just a kid, too...

00:11:31.891 --> 00:11:34.060
I wonder if he was bullied or something...

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:36.696
His mom was crying like crazy.

00:11:36.696 --> 00:11:37.897
What a shame...

00:11:37.897 --> 00:11:39.432
Umm...

00:11:39.432 --> 00:11:41.957
Where did this happen?

00:11:45.171 --> 00:11:48.572
Johann... Johann...

00:11:56.282 --> 00:11:59.385
Is it true? Did Johann really...?

00:11:59.385 --> 00:12:03.719
After he came to deliver this today...

00:12:06.859 --> 00:12:08.520
Malek!

00:12:25.945 --> 00:12:30.382
Malek, let's let them be alone for now.

00:12:30.382 --> 00:12:32.518
Oh, Lord...

00:12:32.518 --> 00:12:38.090
Please... Please save Johann's spirit...

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:45.121
Please save him, Lord... Save Johann's spirit...

00:13:07.853 --> 00:13:11.657
If I hadn't noticed then...

00:13:11.657 --> 00:13:14.785
...the same might've
happened to Malek someday, too...

00:13:30.876 --> 00:13:36.816
I feel really bad about Johann.
If only I had noticed sooner...

00:13:36.816 --> 00:13:41.187
There was nothing you could do.
Not even God was able to help him.

00:13:41.187 --> 00:13:42.955
Malek...

00:13:42.955 --> 00:13:48.594
Johann always prayed here
that he would stop being bullied,

00:13:48.594 --> 00:13:52.364
that his mom would find a real job soon,

00:13:52.364 --> 00:13:56.402
and that his brother and sister
wouldn't be treated like outsiders...

00:13:56.402 --> 00:13:59.972
But God never listened to him.

00:13:59.972 --> 00:14:03.876
Why? Is it wrong to be poor?!

00:14:03.876 --> 00:14:06.879
Does God bully people who
aren't from this country too?!

00:14:06.879 --> 00:14:11.050
Why didn't He help Johann?!

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:12.718
Well...

00:14:12.718 --> 00:14:15.721
Why aren't the ones who
picked on Johann being punished?!

00:14:15.721 --> 00:14:18.324
They believe in the same God!

00:14:18.324 --> 00:14:21.894
Johann prayed so hard,
but he was beat up everyday!

00:14:21.894 --> 00:14:26.265
Sometimes they wouldn't
even let his mom ride the bus,

00:14:26.265 --> 00:14:29.835
just because she "looks too poor"!

00:14:29.835 --> 00:14:32.360
Why is it like this?!

00:14:35.207 --> 00:14:39.945
Malek... God is watching.

00:14:39.945 --> 00:14:44.583
But He expects us to
handle things on our own first.

00:14:44.583 --> 00:14:46.385
We're all human beings.

00:14:46.385 --> 00:14:48.888
We can come to an
understanding if we try hard.

00:14:48.888 --> 00:14:51.156
Try hard doing what?

00:14:51.156 --> 00:14:54.560
Talking. If we try our
hardest to discuss things...

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:57.630
They wouldn't understand!

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:01.901
I speak the same language,
but they don't hear me!

00:15:01.901 --> 00:15:06.705
I believe in the same God,
but they call me a demon!

00:15:06.705 --> 00:15:09.074
How am I supposed to
talk with people like that?!

00:15:09.074 --> 00:15:10.910
Malek...

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:15.047
Have you ever walked down the
street and had rocks thrown at you?

00:15:15.047 --> 00:15:19.950
You haven't, have you? People
like you would never understand!

00:15:23.355 --> 00:15:28.160
I'm sorry... I don't know
what I'm supposed to say...

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:30.060
I'm pathetic...

00:15:32.665 --> 00:15:36.969
I'm sorry. It isn't your fault, Amanda...

00:15:36.969 --> 00:15:38.402
Malek...

00:15:42.041 --> 00:15:46.912
Malek... You're right that
I might not understand how it is at all.

00:15:46.912 --> 00:15:50.616
But this won't solve anything.

00:15:50.616 --> 00:15:53.642
I will keep you safe.

00:15:55.888 --> 00:15:57.790
I'm sure things will work out.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:02.695
No, we'll make things work.
We'll change how things are now.

00:16:02.695 --> 00:16:07.099
Even God will be watching us.

00:16:07.099 --> 00:16:08.896
Yeah...

00:16:10.135 --> 00:16:13.505
Amanda doesn't understand after all...

00:16:13.505 --> 00:16:17.771
There is no God anymore...

00:16:32.791 --> 00:16:36.128
Captain Wolf, this disk
was delivered last night.

00:16:36.128 --> 00:16:37.329
A disk?

00:16:37.329 --> 00:16:40.265
It apparently has
information pertaining to Blue.

00:16:40.265 --> 00:16:46.939
Yeesh. Yet another "helpful"
scoop from some do-gooder civilian?

00:16:46.939 --> 00:16:49.074
Sounds like it.

00:16:49.074 --> 00:16:51.343
Sometimes jokes can become reality.

00:16:51.343 --> 00:16:53.712
Mei-Fong, check it out for now.

00:16:53.712 --> 00:16:55.373
Yes, sir.

00:16:57.883 --> 00:17:00.519
Oh, this is from the other day.

00:17:00.519 --> 00:17:03.188
Did a security camera
catch it all or something?

00:17:03.188 --> 00:17:07.022
Doesn't look like there's
any new information here.

00:17:10.095 --> 00:17:12.364
Stop!

00:17:12.364 --> 00:17:15.567
Play that last part again.

00:17:15.567 --> 00:17:17.228
Yes, sir.

00:17:19.338 --> 00:17:21.473
There!

00:17:21.473 --> 00:17:22.906
Now zoom in on him!

00:17:27.746 --> 00:17:29.407
He's...

00:17:37.222 --> 00:17:41.420
...in the best interest of your other children.

00:17:46.732 --> 00:17:49.394
Well, I must be going now.

00:18:05.751 --> 00:18:10.689
Wasn't that the principal
just now? Did he come to visit you?

00:18:10.689 --> 00:18:12.350
Yes...

00:18:19.331 --> 00:18:21.767
Did the principal give you that?

00:18:21.767 --> 00:18:25.370
I'm... a horrible mother...

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:30.442
Oh, Johann! Forgive me!

00:18:30.442 --> 00:18:33.612
Then that money was for...

00:18:33.612 --> 00:18:38.550
He told me not to say
Johann died because of bullying...

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:41.553
He said it would hurt the school's reputation,

00:18:41.553 --> 00:18:45.591
and that the bullies' parents have
their social standings to maintain...

00:18:45.591 --> 00:18:50.696
You can't do that! That will mean
Johann-kun died for nothing!

00:18:50.696 --> 00:18:54.466
You can't allow this! Let's fight this together!

00:18:54.466 --> 00:18:56.866
I'll go talk to the principal!

00:19:03.208 --> 00:19:11.377
If it means the other children
can live even a little easier, I...

00:19:16.221 --> 00:19:17.848
I see...

00:19:23.395 --> 00:19:25.295
I'm sorry to have disturbed you.

00:19:27.266 --> 00:19:28.367
Yes?

00:19:28.367 --> 00:19:32.704
Amanda! We've IDed Blue!

00:19:32.704 --> 00:19:35.307
I'm sending an image.

00:19:35.307 --> 00:19:36.308
This is...!

00:19:36.308 --> 00:19:42.548
We're going to work with the
police to scour the surrounding areas!

00:19:42.548 --> 00:19:44.743
I'll rendezvous with you shortly!

00:19:45.584 --> 00:19:47.819
I'll try to be back as soon as I can.

00:19:47.819 --> 00:19:52.090
This isn't going to be easy
for us, but let's both try our best!

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:53.387
See you later!

00:20:07.573 --> 00:20:09.564
You're next.

00:20:25.891 --> 00:20:29.895
Joseph, it looks like your real identity is out.

00:20:29.895 --> 00:20:35.231
See, what did I tell you? You're so unbeautiful.

00:20:42.374 --> 00:20:44.209
I can't stand it anymore...

00:20:44.209 --> 00:20:46.778
Everyone, everything...

00:20:46.778 --> 00:20:52.842
Then why not just change it yourself?

00:21:24.516 --> 00:21:28.919
Everything is progressing as intended.

00:21:47.239 --> 00:21:55.113
The ever-flowing songs search my memory

00:21:55.113 --> 00:22:07.225
The pain etched out by the
times slowly brings me back

00:22:07.225 --> 00:22:10.462
Embrace the sadness

00:22:10.462 --> 00:22:17.903
I know, the days that have passed by

00:22:17.903 --> 00:22:22.407
When I look up, it doesn't spill down

00:22:22.407 --> 00:22:28.980
As it trickles down the window,
sad rain rattles the heated isolation

00:22:28.980 --> 00:22:34.353
Tonight I will be forsaken by sleep

00:22:34.353 --> 00:22:42.160
It's almost as if I'm traveling
to a country no one's ever heard of

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:48.500
I'm all alone, and my words
don't get through to anyone

00:22:48.500 --> 00:22:50.569
Wow wow

00:22:50.569 --> 00:22:58.577
Now my heart is frozen and waiting

00:22:58.577 --> 00:23:05.676
because it wants a phone
call so it can connect with you

00:23:13.458 --> 00:23:16.261
A blade of hate is unsheathed.

00:23:16.261 --> 00:23:21.032
Intoxicated by the sweetness of
revenge, it sets out for destruction.

00:23:21.032 --> 00:23:25.737
Episode 8: "Weak No Longer."

00:23:25.737 --> 00:23:30.265
He believed that this
punishment was true justice.
